{"name": "Furyball: Rogue Revenge", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u><strong>AN ACTION ROGUELITE WITH A BOUNCING BULLET BALL</strong></u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"540\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/82b5a5a7d9d8a0c591f593b4410c6b4a.poster.avif?t=1787737393\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/82b5a5a7d9d8a0c591f593b4410c6b4a.webm?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/82b5a5a7d9d8a0c591f593b4410c6b4a.mp4?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In a sun-scorched future, the <i><strong>Furyball</strong></i>, a new bloody sport rules one of the last bastions of civilization.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You are an outsider from the slums, armed with a Furyball and with nothing to lose. You have one night to cross a city ruled by dangerous sports gangs and reach the <strong><i>Furydome</i></strong> for your final battle.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Master your Furyball, upgrade your gear, create unstoppable combos of rebounds and kick some asses with your ball!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>BOUNCE YOUR WAY TO VICTORY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">To fight across Neo-Arcadia, you can only trust your loyal Furyball. Use good positioning and clever timing to launch your Furyball at neck-breaking speed. Harness the chaos\u2026or die trying!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/ba75622b03daf6ad71fb8d8273693c47.poster.avif?t=1787737393\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/ba75622b03daf6ad71fb8d8273693c47.webm?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/ba75622b03daf6ad71fb8d8273693c47.mp4?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>TONS OF BUILDS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each new run is an opportunity to create and discover new strategies and combos by modding your Furyball with tons of unique modules! Burn, crush, bleed, and destroy your enemies by fusing and combining modules to create brand new synergies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/77bbe9d6c4717cf38718018a7f959bc2.poster.avif?t=1787737393\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/77bbe9d6c4717cf38718018a7f959bc2.webm?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/77bbe9d6c4717cf38718018a7f959bc2.mp4?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>EVER EVOLVING, EVER CHANGING</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore Neo-Arcadia across several districts filled with dozens of deadly, pinball-inspired arenas! Death is but an opportunity! Unlock and upgrade new equipment to further customize your build and wreak havoc through the streets! Each run is a unique odyssey full of possibilities.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/52aee33dc18bfaf145f1b970f1be1499.poster.avif?t=1787737393\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/52aee33dc18bfaf145f1b970f1be1499.webm?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/52aee33dc18bfaf145f1b970f1be1499.mp4?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>A CITADEL CRAWLING WITH GANGS</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Battle your way through a city ruled by unique sport-obsessed gangs! Each with their own style, tricks, and deadly quirks. Adapt your build, shift your playstyle, and crush the boss of every district!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/3dfdd9c7b4c8307cba8f5dfdc2bd3b82.poster.avif?t=1787737393\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/3dfdd9c7b4c8307cba8f5dfdc2bd3b82.webm?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/3dfdd9c7b4c8307cba8f5dfdc2bd3b82.mp4?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>GRINDHOUSE RETROFUTURIST APOCALYPSE</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">A hardcore odyssey through a gritty wasteland dripping with 70s retrofuturist flair, backed by a discopunk soundtrack from Toxic Avenger. Think Tarantino\u2019s Grindhouse - homage to exploitation films of the 1970\u2019s - mixed with Mad Max and Rollerball!\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"658\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/1c27f02e124bb5c2aca70263bd100c28.poster.avif?t=1787737393\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/1c27f02e124bb5c2aca70263bd100c28.webm?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/extras/1c27f02e124bb5c2aca70263bd100c28.mp4?t=1787737393\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Wishlist</strong> to get notified. <strong>Follow</strong> to see announcements. Join our <strong>Discord</strong> to help us create the first \"<strong>Rogue</strong>\u00a0<strong>Beat'em Ball\"!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>Rebound Team.</i>\u00a0</p> </div>", "short_desc": "Furyball is a fast-paced action roguelite where your only weapon is a bouncing bullet ball. Control the chaos, shatter enemies, and survive sport-themed arenas inspired by pinball and grindhouse cinema.", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2713120/225e9ad013f84d04995c21b7866413e7c5a2a6d3/header.jpg?t=1787737393", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Early Access", "Action Roguelike", "Pinball", "Top-Down", "Violent", "Beat 'em up"], "developers": "Rebound", "publishers": "Rebound", "release_date": "Sep 23, 2026", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "2713120", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "27 May 2026 - Demo", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/EVnMgiMTbe4", "first_seen": 1779840000.0}